I'd like everyone to close your eyes.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:14.060
Now, bring to mind a picture
of a computer engineer.

00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:16.110
Maybe typing away at a terminal.

00:00:16.110 --> 00:00:18.100
All right, you got it?

00:00:19.270 --> 00:00:21.040
Okay, now open them.

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:28.455
I'm betting that what you thought
of probably didn't look like this.

00:00:28.455 --> 00:00:30.900
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH]
&gt;&gt; Now,

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:34.180
it's true,
I'm past the age of playing with dolls.

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:38.680
But when I saw that Mattel had
