00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:40.835
I got super excited.

00:00:40.835 --> 00:00:42.200
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH]
&gt;&gt; I mean,

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:45.010
how cool is it that
there's a mainstream toy

00:00:45.010 --> 00:00:49.110
telling young girls that they can be
