00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:53.750
I mean it even came with
a super cool book that

00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:58.730
was talking about how Barbie is creating a
game to each kids to play with computers.

00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:08.160
Except when Barbie's sister asked her if
she can play the game Barbie's response?

00:01:09.820 --> 00:01:12.950
No I'm just designing the game.

00:01:12.950 --> 00:01:15.324
I'll need Steven and
Brian to help me build it.

00:01:15.324 --> 00:01:17.367
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH]
&gt;&gt; What?

00:01:17.367 --> 00:01:20.240
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH]
&gt;&gt; You're telling me that computer

00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:22.855
engineer Barbie can't even code?

00:01:22.855 --> 00:01:28.177
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH]
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH]

00:01:28.177 --> 00:01:29.198
&gt;&gt; On top of that,

00:01:29.198 --> 00:01:34.148
she needs the guys to save the day a
